# Bootstrap artifact
.bootstrap.tar.gz

# Pass 1 review evidence. Written by scripts/review-capture.sh into the worktree root,
# handed to the other two review passes, and never committed -- it is a snapshot of one
# machine at one moment, not a project artifact. Tracks A-D all left theirs untracked;
# this rule makes that the default rather than a thing each track has to remember.
review-capture-*.md

# End-to-end run artifacts. One directory per run, holding the digest as uploaded, the
# gists, the drafts, the rendered card and the outbound blocks. They are the INSTRUMENT
# of prompt 04, not a project artifact: derived from somebody's corpus, different every
# run, and large. Same rule as review-capture-*.md, and for the same reason.
cloud/e2e/runs/

# AARP track — per-member demo state and run bookkeeping
aarp/data/members/
aarp/data/refresh_log.jsonl
